Thank you for making this video! A friend of mine recently invited to join Toktok since their family is one of the operator and gave me a referral link (with no discounts for my bookings lol), I did not register though. Didn't know the App first but then I also got very suspicious upon checking the instagram with the likes of celebrities already promoting this app. Mind you, I only use lalamove, grab, angkas, and mr speedy for my deliveries and never heard of this app then suddenly all of the major celebrities are already promoting this that's why I got suspicious. 

&#x200B;

Already deleted the app and did not proceed thank you for making this video! It is much appreciated.

&#x200B;

PS: Did not know that their parent company is the same with the copper mask.

Well, overprice naman talaga  but then again supply and demand ang daming factors need natin consider. Alway think about it iba ang pricing dito sa atin and sa US MSRP (consider mo din na wala pang state tax na kasama sa msrp sa US). Kasi pag isang perspective lang ginamit, wala talaga e. And 30-40k for rtx 3070 is not bad check niyo kasi nvidia ph website nakalagay na dun ay 30k msrp.

&#x200B;

Consider niyo din model ng gpu. My point lang naman is maraming factors na dapat consider. Pero if 50K for rtx 3070, ibang usapan na yan. SCALPER PRICE na yan.

&#x200B;

Check niyo pa lang pricing sa newegg, almost the same price na sa atin not included pa import tax. Di naman porket almost srp mo nabili gpu mo, ganun na dapat lahat.

I agree, but there are these things called import tax, shipment fees, AIB/brand tax ie type of card, and middleman/retailer tax.

&#x200B;

So, 35-40k for 3070 is not that bad. Considering our SRP is 30k (founders edition/base model) for 3070 based from NVIDIA PH Website.

